      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additional ideas (optional and unnecessary).\n\nSuggestion: if the difference between user's current Sound FX volume settings and the default ones suggested by the creator of the world exceeds a specific value (for instance, 20%), the user gets a notification about different volume settings in this world. \n\nExample: World Author (User A) sets default volume settings at 45%, User B has Sound FX volume set at 73%, joins the world by User A and receives a message/notification telling User B that their volume settings have been changed to 45%.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
