      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's your choice. Now that you explained why you're sceptical about the solution, if you don't like my idea, feel free to ignore it. I met and also made a lot of worlds that were designed for users with 100% sound FX volume settings only, and it gets extremely confusing when you can't hear the things you're supposed to hear, and yet, I think this feature might as well be optional, just as most other UX features VRChat implemented over the past couple of years.",
      "viewerReactions": null
