  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-24T23:46:29.144Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Issue: every VRChat world is created for users with different volume settings, some audio sources are supposed to be heard at 100%, some others only at 20% max, and sometimes, whenever users go to a new world, they have to change their audio settings. \n\nSolution: let world creators make their own default Sound FX volume presets that users automatically switch to immediately after they join the respective world.",
